{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark, violent world of CYBER-ASSASSIN\u2122 in the <i>Vengeance Demo</i>, an early development showcase of the Cyber-Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.poster.avif?t=1771392835\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.webm?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.mp4?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Hack and Slash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, brutal combat inspired by the classic <i>God of War games</i>, <i>Devil May Cry</i>, <i>Ninja Gaiden</i>, and <i>Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance</i>, featuring stylish, violent combos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a hostile facility filled with deadly enemies, mini-bosses like the Spider-Sentinels, and environmental challenges such as the morgue puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.poster.avif?t=1771392835\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.webm?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.mp4?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance Awakens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a brutal transformation into a cyborg assassin, Kane awakens with no memories - but his survival instincts remain intact. Trapped in a facility run by the Zenith Corporation, he must rely on his skill, fury, and sheer will to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.poster.avif?t=1771392835\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.webm?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.mp4?t=1771392835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>early development demo</strong> \u2014 visuals, systems, and gameplay are a work in progress and subject to change. Your feedback will help shape the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612730?t=1771392835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612730?t=1771392835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/69ee95b49a7d78c53f7734999a71c711181eabdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771392835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/69ee95b49a7d78c53f7734999a71c711181eabdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771392835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descr